Z||000000||Cooter||12-05-1999||09:42 PM||||Well, I rode with a friend today about 150 miles and drove home an 88 GT. The car is not super nice, but it has potential. I believe that it has every option except T-tops, but it does have the sunroof. Power mirrors, locks, windows, tilt, cruise, interval wipers, rear window defrost, sub-woofer stereo with EQ, and some kind of power accessories built into the driver's seat- looks like lumbar support. New Imron paint, but needs a lot of sanding and buffing because it was painted in the man's garage and has a lot of trash and bugs in it. The funny thing is that it looks a lot like my 85 DuckMobile! <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/newgt.jpg">  <P>sorry about the picture- it was raining really hard!<p>[This message has been edited by Cooter (edited 12-05-1999).]||||reg||10
